@startuml Product Sales Report

title Quy Trình Xem Báo Cáo Bán Hàng Theo Sản Phẩm

actor "Sale Staff" as SaleStaff
participant "Giao Diện\nProduct Sales" as ProductSalesUI
participant "SalesController" as SalesCtrl
database "Database" as DB
participant "Order Model" as OrderModel
participant "OrderDetail Model" as OrderDetailModel
participant "Product Model" as ProductModel

== Xem Báo Cáo Bán Hàng Theo Sản Phẩm ==

SaleStaff -> ProductSalesUI: Truy cập trang báo cáo bán hàng theo sản phẩm
activate ProductSalesUI

ProductSalesUI -> SalesCtrl: productSales()
activate SalesCtrl

SalesCtrl -> OrderDetailModel: Lấy danh sách sản phẩm bán chạy
activate OrderDetailModel
OrderDetailModel -> DB: SELECT products.name as product_name,\nSUM(order_details.quantity) as total_quantity,\nSUM(order_details.cost * order_details.quantity) as total_revenue\nFROM order_details\nJOIN orders ON order_details.order_id = orders.id\nJOIN products ON order_details.product_id = products.id\nWHERE orders.status = 'delivery'\nGROUP BY products.name\nORDER BY total_quantity DESC\nLIMIT 10
DB --> OrderDetailModel: Danh sách sản phẩm bán chạy
OrderDetailModel --> SalesCtrl: Dữ liệu sản phẩm bán chạy
deactivate OrderDetailModel

SalesCtrl -> OrderDetailModel: Lấy danh sách sản phẩm bán gần đây
activate OrderDetailModel
OrderDetailModel -> DB: SELECT products.name as product_name,\norder_details.created_at,\norder_details.quantity,\norder_details.cost,\norder_details.cost * order_details.quantity as total_cost\nFROM order_details\nJOIN orders ON order_details.order_id = orders.id\nJOIN products ON order_details.product_id = products.id\nWHERE orders.status = 'delivery'\nORDER BY order_details.created_at DESC\nLIMIT 5
DB --> OrderDetailModel: Danh sách sản phẩm bán gần đây
OrderDetailModel --> SalesCtrl: Dữ liệu sản phẩm bán gần đây
deactivate OrderDetailModel

SalesCtrl --> ProductSalesUI: Trả về view với dữ liệu báo cáo
deactivate SalesCtrl

ProductSalesUI --> SaleStaff: Hiển thị báo cáo bán hàng theo sản phẩm
deactivate ProductSalesUI

@enduml
